+# Billing classification
+
+`classifyBillingQuestion` in `/src/billing.ts` classifies a message containing the exact lowercase text `refund` as `refund-review`. It classifies every other message as `invoice-question`.
+
+These values are classification labels only. The billing implementation does not establish refund eligibility or approval, payment action, invoice status, or dispute resolution.

